  "hints": [
    "ROUTE-POWER costs 45 and the generator supplies 40, so you need the energy cell at the end of the west corridor. Light the corridors with LAB-LIGHTS to fetch it.",
    "LAB-LIGHTS and ROUTE-POWER (30 and 45) are more than the 60 you will have, so swap them after recording. Your echo can stand in the dark and on the live cable in the north corridor.",
    "Take the cell, then record from the console: up, up onto pad A, down, down, left, left onto pad B, wait once and save. Swap to ROUTE-POWER, launch, then cross the first gate while pad A's countdown still holds it."
  ],
